      <ul><li><a href="https://thebetterindia.com/senior-citizens/dv-shankar-rao-heart-surgery-powerlifting-gold-medals-national-champion-senior-citizen-inspiration-12672094" rel="noopener">The Better India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
