       <h1>Ankita Bhandari Case Sparks Political Controversy</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>A political row has emerged regarding the Ankita Bhandari case following a letter from Rahul Gandhi to President Droupadi Murmu questioning the appointment of Dushyant Gautam. Opposition leaders are urging the President to delay Gautam's oath-taking pending investigation results, while Uttarakhand CM Pushkar Singh Dhami accused the opposition of politicizing a sensitive issue.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-15/ankita-bhandari-case-sparks-political-controversy.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Separately, Delhi authorities have ordered the closure of Central Park in Connaught Place on October 16 and 17 ahead of a proposed protest march. Meanwhile, actor Imran Khan has been issued a 'Leave India' notice by Mumbai police following his detention at a protest, a move his legal team intends to challenge in court.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately captures the core political controversy, Delhi park closure, and Imran Khan's notice concisely.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
