      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/video/ankita-bhandari-case-letter-to-president-over-governor-appointment-sparks-political-row-ytvd-3018297-2026-10-15?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
