      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/why-are-canara-bank-shares-down-7-in-trade-today-after-q2-results-126101500254_1.html" rel="noopener">BS Personal Finance</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
