<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Delhi Police Defends October 10 'Preventive Measures' to Supreme Court — The Daily Prompt</title>
<meta name="description" content="Delhi Police Commissioner Anurag Kumar has informed the Supreme Court that the “preventive measures” taken on October 10 were based on intelligence in">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://news.bharatdn.com/article/2026-10-15/delhi-police-defends-october-10-preventive-measures-to-supre">

