      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/timely-action-india-lauds-us-response-after-illinois-teen-held-over-hindu-temple-attack-plot/articleshow/134957341.cms" rel="noopener">Times of India</a></li></ul>
