     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-10-15 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>'Jailer 2' FDFS Sees Widespread Celebrations, Celebrity Appearances</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Jailer 2</span> <span>#Rajinikanth</span> <span>#Film Release</span></div>
       <p>The release of 'Jailer 2' transformed theatres into vibrant celebration arenas as Rajinikanth's fans gathered for the first-day first-show (FDFS) screenings. Excitement for the Nelson Dilipkumar-directed film was evident with fireworks, drum performances, dancing, and cheering both inside and outside cinemas. Fans enthusiastically celebrated the return of the character Tiger Muthuvel Pandian.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-15/jailer-2-fdfs-sees-widespread-celebrations-celebrity-appeara.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Adding to the festive atmosphere, Rajinikanth's daughter, Soundarya Rajinikanth, was present at Chennai’s Kasi Theatre, where she joined fans in dancing, with videos of her participation gaining social media attention. Actor Dhanush, a known admirer of Rajinikanth, also attended an FDFS screening at Rohini Theatre in Chennai, contributing to the buzz surrounding the film. This attendance occurred despite his separation from Aishwaryaa Rajinikanth.</p><p>Further enhancing the industry's embrace of the release, Sivakarthikeyan shared a touching note expressing his love and admiration for Rajinikanth, and extended his wishes to director Nelson and music composer Anirudh Ravichander. The celebrations for 'Jailer 2' transcended Chennai, reaching various states including Kerala, Karnataka, and Andhra Pradesh, as well as international markets. Early-morning screenings, some as early as 5 am and 6 am, were part of the widespread excitement, complemented by fireworks, traditional drum performances, and DJ music outside theatres.</p><p>With Rajinikanth reuniting with Nelson and Anirudh, the sequel has become a significant talking point among moviegoers. Beyond the fanfare, the film's box office performance and audience response will be crucial in determining whether this latest outing can replicate the phenomenal success of its predecessor.</p><p>What to watch: The box office performance and critical reception of 'Jailer 2'.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately captures the essence and specific details provided in the source text regarding the fan celebrations and celebrity attendance.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/tamil/movies/news/jailer-2-fdfs-celebrations-soundarya-rajinikanth-dances-with-fans-dhanush-and-sivakarthikeyan-cheer-for-the-superstar/articleshow/134956486.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
