       <h1>Sonakshi Sinha and Zaheer Iqbal Release 'Humsafar' for Thriller 'Tu Hai Meri Kiran'</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The makers of the upcoming thriller 'Tu Hai Meri Kiran' have released the track 'Humsafar,' featuring stars Sonakshi Sinha and Zaheer Iqbal. Sung by Vishal Mishra and composed by Ritik Chouhan, the song aims to highlight the emotional connection between the lead characters amidst the film's broader themes of mystery, suspense, and obsession.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-15/sonakshi-sinha-and-zaheer-iqbal-release-humsafar-for-thrille.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Directed by Karan Rawal and produced by Echelon Productions, the movie explores the complexities of one-sided love and its consequences. Following the release of this song, the film is scheduled to arrive in theaters on October 23, 2026.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively synthesizes the essential production details, cast, and release date while maintaining the required brevity.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
