      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/tu-hai-meri-kiran-sonakshi-sinha-and-zaheer-iqbal-explore-the-emotional-side-of-their-thriller-in-new-song-humsafar/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
